<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In Appendix B Design choices and validation ‣ Decompose Sparsely Where You Should, Absorb Densely Where You Should Not" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Low rank.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In Appendix B Design choices and validation ‣ Decompose Sparsely Where You Should, Absorb Densely Where You Should Not" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Rank selection.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In Appendix B Design choices and validation ‣ Decompose Sparsely Where You Should, Absorb Densely Where You Should Not" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Gradient isolation.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
